Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: qcom: manage Caihong speaker playback and supply limits

Provide a separately selected Caihong machine driver with board volume and
PCM-owned supply monitoring. Poll voltage at the OEM ACF interval, update
changed DSP limits, and report terminal faults as PCM XRUNs. Codec helpers
check hardware operations without requiring exact board tuning profiles.

Small runtime parameters use the APM callback with correlated tokens and
bounded replies. The firmware package supplies the scene-0 graph and tuning.

